@baseUrl = http://localhost:5192
@origin = http://localhost:5192
@patientEmail = patient@example.com
@patientPassword = PatientP@ss123
@patientId = 1
@doctorId = 1

# Use a disposable local database. These examples create records.
# Credentials are examples, not seeded accounts. Replace them before use.
# Set patientId from login/session and doctorId from the catalogue.
# Replace the date with a future available clinic-local slot.
# Run selected requests, not the whole file against production.

### Health and database readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Public clinic profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clinic/profile
Accept: application/json

### Public services
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/service
Accept: application/json

### Public doctors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor
Accept: application/json

### Register patient (the client must retain the Set-Cookie response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "firstName": "API Test",
  "email": "{{patientEmail}}",
  "password": "{{patientPassword}}"
}

### Patient login (sets the HttpOnly dc_auth cookie; no token is returned in JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "{{patientEmail}}",
  "password": "{{patientPassword}}"
}

### Restore the current cookie session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session
Accept: application/json

### Read the authenticated patient's appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointmentrequest/patient/{{patientId}}
Accept: application/json

### Create an authenticated appointment request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointmentrequest
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "firstName": "API Test",
  "phone": "+79990000000",
  "appointmentDate": "2027-01-15T10:00:00",
  "comment": "HTTP file smoke request",
  "doctorId": {{doctorId}}
}

### Ask Denta (production requires a matching Origin header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "sessionId": "http-file-smoke",
  "message": "What services are available?",
  "history": [],
  "lang": "en"
}

### Logout and expire the cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{origin}}

###
# Full route/access documentation: docs/en/API.md
# Postman starter collection: docs/DentalClinic.postman_collection.json
# The IDE HTTP client must keep cookies between requests for authenticated examples.
